<%- include('head') %><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="little-line"></span> YOUR NEXT MANICURE STARTS HERE</p><h1>Little details.<br>Beautiful <em>possibilities.</em></h1><p>A journal of colors, textures, and tiny works of art.<br>Find a design that feels a little like you.</p><a class="button" href="/gallery">Find your inspiration <span><svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><div class="hero-note"><span>✧</span> Thoughtfully created. Endlessly inspiring.</div></div><% if(featured){ %><a href="/design/<%= featured.slug %>" class="hero-art"><img src="<%= featured.photos[0]?.url.startsWith('/art-')?'/assets'+featured.photos[0].url:featured.photos[0]?.url %>" alt="<%= featured.photos[0]?.alt %>" width="800" height="900" fetchpriority="high"><div class="featured-label"><span>IN THE SPOTLIGHT <%= featured.sample?'· SAMPLE ILLUSTRATION':'' %></span><h2><%= featured.title %></h2><p>Explore the design <span><svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></p></div></a><% } %><span class="hero-spark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></section><section class="inspiration-strip"><span>MADE TO INSPIRE</span><p>A mood for every manicure.</p><a href="/gallery?style=Minimal">Minimal & chic</a><span>✧</span><a href="/gallery?style=Floral">Soft & romantic</a><span>✧</span><a href="/gallery?style=Abstract">A little playful</a></section><section class="latest section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM THE JOURNAL</p><h2>The latest little obsessions</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/gallery">View all designs <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></a></div><div class="card-grid"><% posts.slice(0,3).forEach(post=>{ %><%- include('card',{post}) %><% }) %></div><% if(!posts.length){ %><p>New designs are on their way. Check back soon.</p><% } %></section><section class="about-teaser"><div class="about-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>Color outside<br>the ordinary.</span><b>✧</b></div><div><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE BRUSH</p><h2>A love for the<br>little things.</h2><p>A beautiful manicure can turn an ordinary day into something special. This is a place for experimenting, collecting inspiration, and finding joy in the details.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Meet the studio <svg class="arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></a></div></section><%- include('newsletter') %><%- include('foot') %>
